{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/communitydetection\/louvainevent"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LouvainEvent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedGraph","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each level starts with local moving: level vertices are taken in number order, sweep after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sweep, and each moves to the neighboring community that raises the modularity most, reported"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as it moves. Communities are named by level vertex numbers. When a sweep moves nothing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level is finished, with its partition of the graph’s vertices and that partition’s modularity."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"While the modularity rose by more than the threshold, the communities are then merged into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next level’s vertices, numbered by their labels in the partition just reported. At the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level the level vertices are the graph’s vertices, numbered in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order (their vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indices when the graph has them). The method ends after a level whose modularity did not rise"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enough, or after an aggregation whose local moving moved nothing."}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/aggregate(vertexCount:)","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/levelFinished(_:modularity:)","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/move(_:from:to:gain:)"],"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"abstract":[{"text":"What the Louvain method reports, in order.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LouvainEvent"}],"title":"LouvainEvent","roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","modules":[{"name":"CommunityDetection"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LouvainEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"LouvainEvents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvents.swift#L15"},"externalID":"s:18CommunityDetection12LouvainEventO"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identif